---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import {SITE} from '../data/site.mjs';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact and professional networks" description="Contact Isaac Daroch in writing about research, teaching or accessibility; find his existing professional profile links."><div class="shell page-header"><h1>Start a conversation.</h1><p>Research, teaching, collaboration and accessibility feedback. English and Spanish.</p></div><div class="shell prose"><h2>Email</h2><p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} id="contact-email">{SITE.email}</a></p><button data-copy-target="contact-email" data-copy-status="contact-status" disabled>Copy email address</button><p id="contact-status" role="status"></p><h2>Professional networks</h2><ul><li><a href={SITE.github}>GitHub: source repositories</a></li><li><a href={SITE.orcid}>ORCID: researcher identifier</a></li><li><a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn: professional updates</a></li></ul><p>This site does not collect a message form. If copying is unavailable, select the visible email address. External profiles may have their own accessibility limitations.</p></div></BaseLayout>
